  "details": "Any world (SDK2 or SDK3) with the combat system has broken avatar scaling.  \n\nIf you load into a world with a combat system, your avatar's scale is automatically reset to default.  Re-scaling the avatar makes it pop to the new scale for a split second, then immediately puts it back at default.  After that, if you click to reset scale, it will put you at the larger/smaller scale you tried previously.  \n\nTried uploading a new, clean project of Cyan Laser's combat system example scene, and it does the same thing.",
